ames></name><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Dirlewanger</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Testolin</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Cosson</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Cipriani</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Monforte</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Georgi</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Abbott</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Arus</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mapping with a few plants: using selective mapping for microsatellite saturation of the <italic>Prunus </italic>reference map</article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2005</year><volume>171</volume><fpage>1305</fpage><lpage>1309</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16118196</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1534/genetics.105.043661</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimura</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Saito</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kotobuki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuta</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Liebhard</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Gessler</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Weg</surname><given-names>WE van de</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayashi</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic linkage maps of Japanese and European pears aligned to the apple consensus map</article-title><source>Acta Hort</source><year>2004</year><volume>663</volume><fpage>51</fpage><lpage>56</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journa